      "title": "Selection rate by protected group",
      "description": "Share of recent requests in each group selected for intervention. Measured on the decision that was actually returned, not on the raw probability — under a group-aware threshold policy those two are not the same number. A line that ends rather than falls means the group dropped below the 30-slot minimum sample, not that its rate went to zero.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "credit-prometheus"
      },
